  "title": "Grandma&#39;s Pumpkin Tea Bread",
  "description": "This is a good way to use all that pumpkin from your cleaned out jack-o-lanterns! Just freeze and use as Christmas gifts!",
  "authors": [
    "Kristy"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:05:00-04:00",
